{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Plot</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just as Sekar is struggling to earn money to get by, Laras came up with the idea to invite Sekar to explore an abandoned hospital, in hopes of going viral just like people on the internet. Sekar hesitantly agree with the pressure of needing money. What will happen? What will they face in the midst of the darkness enveloping this hospital?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Gameplay</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will switch alternatively between the two characters' points of view, Laras and Sekar. Free yourself from the hospital by uncovering mysteries to reunite with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Uncover a story</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal the secrets and truths behind the abandoned hospital you are exploring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Voice Over</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive voice over in creating a tense atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Puzzle and &quot;Figure&quot;</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete a variety of puzzles and save yourself from the &quot;figure&quot; who tries to pull you into the pitless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354770?t=1734439712","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354770?t=1734439712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354770/cc3fb366ac2d3629153f34269925f604be0baeba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734439712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354770/cc3fb366ac2d3629153f34269925f604be0bae